#     description: "Concept DOI (all versions)"
abstract: >
  AtmoTrack detects and tracks atmospheric systems — Cut-Off Lows (COL),
  upper-level and surface cyclones/anticyclones, tropical cyclones, jet
  streams, atmospheric rivers, Mesoscale Convective Systems (MCS) and
  fronts — from ERA5 reanalysis or any other CF-compliant NetCDF dataset,
  over a configurable geographic domain and time period.
keywords:
  - atmospheric-science
  - ERA5
  - reanalysis
  - cut-off-lows
  - cyclone-tracking
  - tropical-cyclones
  - atmospheric-rivers
  - jet-stream
  - python
